\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.2}{\ignorespaces Maturity-Aware AI Routing architectural gate. The \texttt  {LatePaymentPredictor.predict\_or\_heuristic()} method inspects the tenant's invoice count $n_t$ against the inclusive boundary $n_t \le \texttt  {COLD\_START\_INVOICE\_THRESHOLD} = 1{,}000$ (equivalently, $n_t < \textsf  {MIN\_LOCAL\_EXPLANATION\_RECORDS} = 1{,}001$). Cold-start tenants are dispatched to the global heuristic served from \texttt  {cold\_start\_heuristic.json}; data-mature tenants are dispatched to the per-tenant SHAP/LIME pipeline. Both branches emit a single schema-conformant response payload.}}{28}{figure.caption.9}\protected@file@percent }
