\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces Predictive performance across simulated tenant tiers under the leakage-free feature regime. AUC-ROC is uniformly modest in tiers~A--D ($\approx 0.61$--$0.66$) and rises anomalously to $0.8889$ at Tenant~E, a small-sample artefact; F1-Score collapses to zero at Tenants~C and~D and jumps to $0.6667$ at Tenant~E. Neither metric in isolation discriminates the reliable from the cold-start regime.}}{37}{figure.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
